sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Gateway
    participant Authz
    participant Api
    participant Mongo

    User->>Gateway: Request with JWT
    Gateway->>Authz: Validate token
    Authz-->>Gateway: Token valid
    Gateway->>Api: Forward request
    Api->>Mongo: Query or mutate data
    Mongo-->>Api: Result
    Api-->>Gateway: Response
    Gateway-->>User: Final response
